;; KOTOBA-989 / PR #897 Spec-Gap Escalation: Standard O(N) Amortized Text Builder
;; Contract (v1 proposed).
;;
;; Defines:
;;   - Tier 0 (portable Profile-6 O(N log N) chunk-tree & bounded :io/write
;;     interim pattern, strictly labeled non-final), and
;;   - Tier 1 (KOTOBA-989 target single-threaded affine `:text-builder` type
;;     with :linear-return helper composition, O(N) amortized complexity,
;;     interleaving-invariant allocation, and bounded chunked finalization).
;;
;; This specification is a :proposed contract. It mutates no lang/limits.edn
;; v1 value, no payload-v2 Definition CID, and no Profile 6 existing program
;; meaning.

